99
00:03:14.620 --> 00:03:17.214
And then I do just a little green onion scallion on top.

100
00:03:17.214 --> 00:03:18.450
Oh, I love scallions.

101
00:03:18.450 --> 00:03:19.820
Because it's gorgeous that way.

102
00:03:19.820 --> 00:03:22.970
Garnish is, it's so holy.

103
00:03:22.970 --> 00:03:24.050
I will say this.

104
00:03:24.050 --> 00:03:25.200
Mm.
When I wanted

105
00:03:25.200 --> 00:03:26.570
a little something something

106
00:03:26.570 --> 00:03:28.730
in my vegetarian version of things,

107
00:03:28.730 --> 00:03:30.387
I would do little croutons.

108
