A nice smoke.

121
00:03:54.270 --> 00:03:55.350
Mm-hmm.

122
00:03:55.350 --> 00:03:57.200
A really good saltiness.

123
00:03:57.200 --> 00:03:58.033
Mm-hmm.

124
00:03:58.033 --> 00:04:01.550
Which I have to say bland split pea is not good.

125
00:04:01.550 --> 00:04:03.900
No.
This is seasoned perfectly.

126
00:04:03.900 --> 00:04:05.180
Thank you.

127
